95
00:12:17,340 --> 00:12:19,458
I've got plenty of energy left over!

96
00:12:22,220 --> 00:12:23,080
That's right.

97
00:12:23,380 --> 00:12:27,180
With Miss Tovera here, we'll
be back on our feet in no time.

98
00:12:33,380 --> 00:12:38,380
I can finally breathe, but why
do I feel like I'm gonna...

99
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,820
Uhhh... Hey, you.

100
